#: ../../../policy/CMP0228.rst:2
msgid "CMP0228"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../policy/CMP0228.rst:6
msgid "File set usage requirements are evaluated for the consumer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../policy/CMP0228.rst:8
msgid ""
"The :prop_fs:`INTERFACE_COMPILE_DEFINITIONS`, :prop_fs:`INTERFACE_COMPILE_OPTIONS`, "
"and :prop_fs:`INTERFACE_INCLUDE_DIRECTORIES` file set properties specify "
"usage requirements for compiling the sources of a file set in a consuming "
"target. In CMake 4.5 and below, generator expressions in these properties "
"are evaluated for the target that owns the file set, so "
"that :genex:`TARGET_PROPERTY:prop` reads ``prop`` from the owner rather than "
"from the consumer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../policy/CMP0228.rst:17
msgid ""
"CMake 4.6 and above prefer to evaluate these properties for the consumer, as "
"for other :ref:`usage requirements <Target Usage Requirements>`.  This "
"policy provides compatibility with projects that have not been updated to "
"expect the new behavior.  Its setting is recorded by each target as it is "
"created, and affects the file sets owned by that target."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../policy/CMP0228.rst:23
msgid ""
"The ``OLD`` behavior for this policy is to evaluate the properties for the "
"target that owns the file set.  The ``NEW`` behavior is to evaluate them for "
"the consumer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../policy/include/STANDARD_ADVICE.rst:1
msgid ""
"This policy was introduced in CMake version |INTRODUCED_IN_CMAKE_VERSION|. "
"It may be set by :command:`cmake_policy` "
"or :command:`cmake_minimum_required`. If it is not set, CMake |"
"WARNS_OR_DOES_NOT_WARN|, and uses ``OLD`` behavior."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../policy/include/DEPRECATED.rst:2
msgid ""
"The ``OLD`` behavior of a policy is :ref:`deprecated by definition <cmake-"
"policies-intro>` and may be removed in a future version of CMake."
msgstr ""
